msgid "Activation mechanism"
msgstr "Mécanisme d'activation"

#: ../../source/development.rst:238 8711119dfd7b415fbf3f65f2ebef4926
msgid ""
"The activation mechanism helps make requests to sites requiring "
"additional authentication like cookies, JWT tokens, or custom headers."
msgstr ""
"Le mécanisme d'activation permet d'interroger les sites qui exigent une "
"authentification supplémentaire : cookies, jetons JWT ou en-têtes "
"personnalisés."

#: ../../source/development.rst:240 49a33164a1254c92aa7af386cd949edc
msgid "Let's study the Vimeo site check record from the Maigret database:"
msgstr "Examinons la fiche de vérification du site Vimeo dans la base de Maigret :"

