msgid "The activation method is:"
msgstr "La méthode d'activation est :"

#: ../../source/development.rst:282 44e0f0bb1186492c812d0bf6801f735d
msgid "Here's how the activation process works when a JWT token becomes invalid:"
msgstr ""
"Voici comment se déroule le processus d'activation lorsqu'un jeton JWT "
"devient invalide :"

#: ../../source/development.rst:284 0c52dda242774fdfbf4734ffbd9fa2c3
msgid ""
"The site check makes an HTTP request to ``urlProbe`` with the invalid "
"token"
msgstr ""
"La vérification du site envoie une requête HTTP à ``urlProbe`` avec le "
"jeton invalide"

#: ../../source/development.rst:285 bb09eac30cb147b7bce4b33f8b0db418
msgid ""
"The response contains an error message specified in the "
"``activation``/``marks`` field"
msgstr ""
"La réponse contient un message d'erreur indiqué dans le champ "
"``activation``/``marks``"

#: ../../source/development.rst:286 3c1946f49ff544bc8762339d18d73758
msgid ""
"When this error is detected, the ``vimeo`` activation function is "
"triggered"
msgstr ""
"Lorsque cette erreur est détectée, la fonction d'activation ``vimeo`` est"
" déclenchée"

#: ../../source/development.rst:287 075145a25d3d45698757b17c1e49efb0
msgid ""
"The activation function obtains a new JWT token and updates it in the "
"site check record"
msgstr ""
"La fonction d'activation obtient un nouveau jeton JWT et le met à jour "
"dans la fiche de vérification du site"

#: ../../source/development.rst:288 bbe1932a3d104efaaef0ed7f348a29ce
msgid ""
"On the next site check (either through retry or a new Maigret run), the "
"valid token is used and the check succeeds"
msgstr ""
