msgstr "Appuyez sur `+ Auto-generate release notes`"

#: ../../source/development.rst:350 f7f3526fe70945ab90e4f70fc10e5560
msgid "Copy all the text from description text field below"
msgstr "Copiez tout le texte du champ de description ci-dessous"

#: ../../source/development.rst:351 8f8fde06fb9240e3b41420a40f732f33
msgid "Paste it to empty text section in `CHANGELOG.md`"
msgstr "Collez-le dans la section vide de `CHANGELOG.md`"

#: ../../source/development.rst:352 f177d5679b0d42878df120a0e19769f4
msgid "*Close the new release page*"
msgstr "*Fermez la page de création de release*"

#: ../../source/development.rst:354 e47f7f434d76421db9672dc4f81561f9
msgid ""
"Keep the ``## What's Changed`` heading, the ``## New Contributors`` "
"section and the ``**Full Changelog**`` line — every existing section in "
"``CHANGELOG.md`` has them."
msgstr ""
"Conservez le titre ``## What's Changed``, la section ``## New "
"Contributors`` et la ligne ``**Full Changelog**`` : toutes les sections "
